35. FINAL STATEMENT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The purpose of this License is to keep CDNPanel openly viewable and welcoming
to community contribution while preventing unauthorised redistribution,
commercial exploitation, rebranding, hosted resale, and appropriation of Cache
Networks' work.

If You want to improve CDNPanel, fork it, experiment, submit issues, and send
pull requests.

If You want to redistribute it, commercialise it, host it for third parties,
rebrand it, incorporate protected code into another distributed project, or
obtain broader rights, You must first obtain permission from Cache Networks.
